-anchor="middle" transform="translate(261.85811614990234 48)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">2014–2020</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(261.85811614990234 350.26822265625)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Year</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" x="163.6047134399414" y="367.42822265625" height="71" width="137.7905731201172" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><line x1="170.6047134399414" y1="384.42822265625" x2="197.6047134399414" y2="384.42822265625" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-end="url(#marker0)"/><line x1="197.6047134399414" y1="384.42822265625" x2="224.6047134399414" y2="384.42822265625" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-start="url(#marker0)"/><text transform="translate(234.6047134399414 391.42822265625)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> captive</text><line x1="170.6047134399414" y1="416.42822265625" x2="197.6047134399414" y2="416.42822265625" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="9 6" marker-end="url(#marker1)"/><line x1="197.6047134399414" y1="416.42822265625" x2="224.6047134399414" y2="416.42822265625" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="9 6" marker-start="url(#marker1)"/><text transform="translate(234.6047134399414 423.42822265625)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> wild</text><line x1="113.45078713553292" y1="175.5" x2="162.91989680698939" y2="188.5" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-end="url(#marker0)" marker-start="url(#marker0)"/><line x1="113.45078713553292" y1="158" x2="162.91989680698939" y2="138" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-dasharray="9 6" marker-end="url(#marker1)" marker-start="url(#marker1)"/><line x1="162.91989680698939" y1="188.5" x2="212.38900647844585" y2="187" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2.4" marker-end="url(#marker0)" marker-start="url(#marker0)"/><line x1="162.9198