19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">2016</text><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"261.85811614990234\" x2=\"261.85811614990234\" y1=\"72\" y2=\"272\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\" transform=\"translate(271.77811614990236 291.84) rotate(-40)\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">2017</text><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"311.3272258213588\" x2=\"311.3272258213588\" y1=\"72\" y2=\"272\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\" transform=\"translate(321.2472258213588 291.84) rotate(-40)\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">2018</text><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"360.7963354928153\" x2=\"360.7963354928153\" y1=\"72\" y2=\"272\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\" transform=\"translate(370.7163354928153 291.84) rotate(-40)\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">2019</text><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"410.26544516427174\" x2=\"410.26544516427174\" y1=\"72\" y2=\"272\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\" transform=\"translate(420.18544516427175 291.84) rotate(-40)\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">2020</text><text text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"translate(261.85811614990234 24)\" fill=\"#000000\" font-size=\"19.84\" font-family=\"Crimson Text\">California Condor Populations </text><text text-anch